<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>❄️ Privacy Policy - Snowwords Vocabulary Helper Extension</h1>
        
        <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: <strong>December 2024</strong></p>
        
        <div class="highlight">
            <strong>Your Privacy Matters:</strong> This extension is designed to help you learn vocabulary while respecting your privacy. We only collect the minimal data necessary to provide vocabulary learning functionality.
        </div>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        
        <h3>Information You Provide:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Selected Text:</strong> Words and phrases you choose to add to your vocabulary</li>
            <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> When you log into your Snowwords account through the extension</li>
            <li><strong>Learning Preferences:</strong> Settings you configure within the extension</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Information Automatically Collected:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Usage Statistics:</strong> Number of words added, learning progress, and study streaks</li>
            <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> Extension version, browser type (for compatibility purposes)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        
        <p>We use the collected information to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Provide AI-powered definitions for words you select</li>
            <li>Sync your vocabulary across devices through your Snowwords account</li>
            <li>Track your learning progress and provide statistics</li>
            <li>Improve the extension's functionality and user experience</li>
            <li>Provide customer support when requested</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Information Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
        
        <div class="highlight">
            <strong>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties.</strong>
        </div>

        <p>Your information may be shared only in these limited circumstances:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> With trusted partners who help us operate the Snowwords platform (e.g., cloud hosting, AI definition services)</li>
            <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law or to protect our legal rights</li>
            <li><strong>Business Transfer:</strong> In the event of a merger or acquisition (users will be notified)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
        
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Local Storage:</strong> Some data is stored locally in your browser for offline access and performance</li>
            <li><strong>Secure Transmission:</strong> All data is transmitted using HTTPS encryption</li>
            <li><strong>Data Retention:</strong> We retain your vocabulary data as long as your account is active</li>
            <li><strong>Security Measures:</strong> We implement industry-standard security practices to protect your data</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
        
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Access:</strong> View all vocabulary data associated with your account</li>
            <li><strong>Update:</strong> Modify or correct your vocabulary and account information</li>
            <li><strong>Delete:</strong> Remove words from your vocabulary or delete your entire account</li>
            <li><strong>Export:</strong> Download your vocabulary data in a portable format</li>
            <li><strong>Opt-out:</strong> Disable the extension at any time through your browser settings</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
        
        <p>The extension uses:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> For authentication and core functionality</li>
            <li><strong>Local Storage:</strong> To cache vocabulary data and user preferences</li>
            <li><strong>No Tracking Cookies:</strong> We do not use cookies for advertising or tracking across websites</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
        
        <p>The Snowwords extension is suitable for users of all ages. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13 without parental consent. If you believe we have collected information from a child under 13, please contact us immediately.</p>

        <h2>8. International Users</h2>
        
        <p>If you are using the extension from outside the United States, please note that your information may be transferred to and processed in the United States, where our servers are located.</p>

        <h2>9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        
        <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. When we do:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>We will post the updated policy on this page</li>
            <li>We will update the "Last Updated" date</li>
            <li>For significant changes, we will notify users through the extension or email</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>10. Third-Party Services</h2>
        
        <p>The extension integrates with:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Snowwords Platform:</strong> For account management and vocabulary sync</li>
            <li><strong>AI Definition Services:</strong> For generating contextual word definitions</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>These services have their own privacy policies, and we encourage you to review them.</p>



        <hr style="margin: 40px 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
        
        <p style="text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
            This privacy policy is part of the <strong>Snowwords</strong><br>
            © 2024 Snowwords. All rights reserved.
        </p>
